---
permalink: /ui_kits/website/baptisms.html
headline: Baptism, First Communion & Confirmation
deck: We gladly baptise new members of whatever age into the family of God — praying for them as they embark on their pilgrimage of faith.
intro_paragraphs:
  - text: At Emmanuel we gladly baptise new members of whatever age into the family of God, praying for them as they embark on their exciting journey and pilgrimage of faith.
  - text: Our baptism services tend to take place at our 10:30 service on the third Sunday of the month. If you'd prefer, we can also offer baptism at our 9:15 Joyful Noise service.
cards:
  - eyebrow: The sacrament of belonging
    title: Baptism
    body: Through baptism we are welcomed into the family of God and the life of the Church. We baptise people of every age — infants, children and adults alike — and walk with each household as they prepare.
  - eyebrow: Once a year · taken by the Bishop
    title: Confirmation
    body: We have a confirmation service once a year. Confirmations are taken by the Bishop and are the occasion for baptised people to 'confirm' the vows that were made on their behalf when they were baptised.
  - eyebrow: Good Shepherd Sunday · from age 8
    title: First Holy Communion
    body: At Emmanuel we admit to First Holy Communion those children who would like to take part in the Eucharist but are not yet old enough to be confirmed. We encourage children to wait to be confirmed until they are much older (around 16 or older), but invite them to participate fully in the sacrament of Holy Communion from around age 8. Admission typically takes place on Good Shepherd Sunday, following a series of 6–8 sessions teaching about the Eucharist.
feature_eyebrow: A growing faith
feature_heading: Welcomed to the Lord's table
feature_body: From the youngest children admitted to First Holy Communion, to those confirmed by the Bishop, we walk with each person as they take their next step in the life of faith — surrounded by the prayers of the whole community.
feature_image: /assets/first-communion.jpg
feature_image_alt: Children and adults presented to the Bishop at a Confirmation and First Holy Communion service
aside_heading: How to begin
aside_body_1: If you are considering having your child baptised, would like to be baptised yourself, or are interested in First Holy Communion or Confirmation, please contact the parish office in the first instance.
aside_body_2: One of the clergy will arrange to meet with you to help you prepare and go through the service with you.
aside_image_1: /assets/feedback/first-communion.jpg
aside_image_1_alt: Preparing children for First Holy Communion at Emmanuel
aside_image_2: /assets/feedback/confirmation.jpg
aside_image_2_alt: Confirmation at Emmanuel Church
callout_heading: A new beginning.
callout_body: Whatever your age, there is a place for you in the family of God at Emmanuel. We would love to walk this journey with you.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<title>{{ headline }} — Emmanuel Church, West Hampstead</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/assets/favicon.ico" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/favicon-32.png" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/assets/apple-touch-icon.png" />
</head>
<body>

{% include "header.njk" %}

  <section class="em-pagehead em-pagehead--band">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="em-breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><a href="baptisms.html">Life Events</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Baptisms & Confirmation</span></div>
      <h1 data-editable="text" data-prop="headline" data-type="span">{{ headline }}</h1>
      <p class="deck" data-editable="text" data-prop="deck" data-type="text">{{ deck }}</p>
      <div class="meta-row"><div class="item"><div class="k">Baptisms</div><div class="v">10:30, third Sunday</div></div><div class="item"><div class="k">Confirmation</div><div class="v">Once a year, with the Bishop</div></div><div class="item"><div class="k">First Communion</div><div class="v">Good Shepherd Sunday</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="em-intro">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="em-body">
        <div data-editable="array" data-prop="intro_paragraphs">
        {% for para in intro_paragraphs %}
          <p{% if loop.first %} class="em-lead"{% endif %} data-editable="array-item">
            <span data-editable="text" data-prop="text" data-type="text">{{ para.text if para.text else para }}</span>
          </p>
        {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:36px" data-editable="array" data-prop="cards">
          {% for card in cards %}
          <div class="em-infocard" data-editable="array-item">
            {% if card.eyebrow %}<span class="tag" data-editable="text" data-prop="eyebrow" data-type="span">{{ card.eyebrow }}</span>{% endif %}
            {% if card.title %}<h3 data-editable="text" data-prop="title" data-type="span">{{ card.title }}</h3>{% endif %}
            {% if card.body %}<p data-editable="text" data-prop="body" data-type="text">{{ card.body }}</p>{% endif %}
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="em-aside">
        <div class="em-aside-card">
          <h4 data-editable="text" data-prop="aside_heading" data-type="span">{{ aside_heading }}</h4>
          <p data-editable="text" data-prop="aside_body_1" data-type="text">{{ aside_body_1 }}</p>
          <p data-editable="text" data-prop="aside_body_2" data-type="text">{{ aside_body_2 }}</p>
          <a href="contact.html" class="em-btn em-btn--primary" style="margin-top:6px">Contact the parish office</a>
        </div>
        <div class="em-well" style="aspect-ratio:3/4">
          <img src="{{ aside_image_1 }}" alt="{{ aside_image_1_alt }}" />
        </div>
        <div class="em-well" style="aspect-ratio:3/4;margin-top:20px">
          <img src="{{ aside_image_2 }}" alt="{{ aside_image_2_alt }}" />
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec sec--feature is-band">
    <div class="sec__inner" style="max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;padding:80px var(--gutter)">
      <div class="em-feature">
        <div class="media em-well"><img src="{{ feature_image }}" alt="{{ feature_image_alt }}" /></div>
        <div>
          <div class="em-ornament is-leading" data-editable="text" data-prop="feature_eyebrow" data-type="span">{{ feature_eyebrow }}</div>
          <h2 class="sec__heading" data-editable="text" data-prop="feature_heading" data-type="span">{{ feature_heading }}</h2>
          <div class="sec__body"><p data-editable="text" data-prop="feature_body" data-type="text">{{ feature_body }}</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="em-callout">
    <div class="inner">
      <div>
        <h3 data-editable="text" data-prop="callout_heading" data-type="span">{{ callout_heading }}</h3>
        <p data-editable="text" data-prop="callout_body" data-type="text">{{ callout_body }}</p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a href="contact.html" class="em-btn em-btn--tan">Contact the parish office</a><a href="service-times.html" class="em-btn em-btn--ghost-light">Service times</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

{% include "footer.njk" %}

</body>
</html>
